You are assisting with business process modelling.

SENTENCES
- Some customers change their mind shortly after the parcel arrives and send it back within two weeks without saying why

STATEMENT
the organisation running the described process is informed of its customer’s decision to withdraw from the contract in accordance with Article 11

Do these sentences, on their own and taken together, state that the statement is true? Answer yes or no with one line of reason.
Answer with one JSON object that follows the JSON schema below. Output only the JSON, with no other text.

JSON SCHEMA
{
  "properties": {
    "answer": {
      "description": "yes if the sentence on its own states it, otherwise no",
      "enum": [
        "yes",
        "no"
      ],
      "title": "Answer",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "reason": {
      "description": "One line of reason",
      "title": "Reason",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "answer",
    "reason"
  ],
  "title": "VerifierOutputV2",
  "type": "object"
}

message.content:
{
  "answer": "no",
  "reason": "The sentence describes a customer action (returning a parcel) but does not explicitly state that the organisation is formally informed of the decision to withdraw in accordance with Article 11."
}
